{
  "name": "@demostudio/ds-feedback",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DSH 反馈飞轮插件：用户纠正沉淀为持久规则（.dsh/rules/ 提案-确认制 rule_propose/rule_apply + 常驻规则段注入 + 回合末纠正关键词预筛命中后挂提示）、损失探针（turn-error/retry/steer/纠正预筛零成本落盘 .dsh/loss/signals.jsonl + 会话健康分 + 规则段损失摘要块）与文本梯度候选（.dsh/gradient/ pending→apply 两段式 gradient_propose/list/apply + 应用台账）。与 ds-instructions（用户手工目录指令）完全解耦。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "dist/index.js",
  "types": "dist/index.d.ts",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc",
    "watch": "tsc --watch",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "lint": "oxlint src tests",
    "test": "vitest run"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "demostudio",
    "dsh",
    "feedback",
    "rules",
    "agent"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent": "0.1.7-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "0.1.7-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-session": "0.1.7-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-system-prompt": "0.1.7-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.1.7-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.4"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.0.0",
    "oxlint": "^1.0.0",
    "typescript": "^5.6.3",
    "vitest": "^3.0.0"
  }
}
